    24	/**
    25	 * The reach audit's own acceptance tests (S3.2).
    26	 *
    27	 * Each case plants one violation and checks that the audit names it. The audit is the thing that will
    28	 * police every later screen, so the failure mode that matters is not "does it catch a bad layout" but
    29	 * "does it stay silent on a bad layout" - that is what these assert against, one rule at a time.
    30	 *
    31	 * Window is 411 x 923 dp, so R1's ceiling is 461.5 dp and R2's is 646.1 dp.
