- **P2** - app/src/test/kotlin/net/montycasa/roux/ui/reach/ReachAssertions.kt:42. The audit walks only the current semantics tree; a bad target in an uncomposed `LazyColumn` row is invisible until that row is composed, so an initial-viewport audit can miss it.
